BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (  # The Myth of the Twin Rivers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (  In ancient times, two villages were separated by a barren valley. Each village had a sacred sp) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    ring that produced five measures of water daily.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (  The Sky Spirits whispered to the villages: "What you pour into the valley shall flow to the ot) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    her side as a river three times as strong.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (  The First Village feared deception. "If we send our water," they said, "the other village may ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    keep it all." So they sent nothing, and both remained parched.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (  But then a wise elder spoke: "True prosperity flows in circles, not lines. Water sent forward ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    must return backward, or the cycle dies.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (  The First Village poured their five measures into the valley. It multiplied to fifteen, reachi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    ng the Second Village as an abundant river. The Second Village rejoiced, but the elder remin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    ded them: "The gift must return, or tomorrow's springs run dry.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (  The Second Village returned seven measures - not merely what was sent, but a fair share of wha) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    t was received. Both villages prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (  The Sky Spirits smiled: "Trust multiplies abundance, but reciprocity sustains it. When one sen) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (    ds with open hands and the other returns with grateful heart, all are blessed.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (  Thus the villages learned: generosity creates wealth, but fairness ensures its eternal flow.) Tj ET
