BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (        eled at this mysterious abundance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      Their king faced temptation: "These seeds are ours now. Why share with strangers?") Tj ET
