BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages were separated by a barren valley. Each village had a sacre) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        d spring that produced five measures of water daily.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      The Sky Spirits whispered to the villages: "What you pour into the valley shall flow to th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        e other side as a river three times as strong.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      The First Village feared deception. "If we send our water," they said, "the other village ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (        may keep it all." So they sent nothing, and both remained parched.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      But then a wise elder spoke: "True prosperity flows in circles, not lines. Water sent forw) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        ard must return backward, or the cycle dies.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      The First Village poured their five measures into the valley. It multiplied to fifteen, re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        aching the Second Village as an abundant river. The Second Village rejoiced, but the eld) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        er reminded them: "The gift must return, or tomorrow's springs run dry.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      The Second Village returned seven measures - not merely what was sent, but a fair share of) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (         what was received. Both villages prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      The Sky Spirits smiled: "Trust multiplies abundance, but reciprocity sustains it. When one) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (         sends with open hands and the other returns with grateful heart, all are blessed.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      Thus the villages learned: generosity creates wealth, but fairness ensures its eternal flo) Tj ET
